"[\n  {\n    \"title\": \"World AIDS Day - Free Rapid HIV Testing\",\n    \"description\": \"December 1, 2026 | 11 AM - 2 PM Get free and confidential HIV testing at either location and play the Kahoot to snag one of the first 40 free boba drinks available! Free HIV Rapid Testing at Triton Health and Wellness Building and LGBT RC Triton Health and Wellness building’s Multipurpose Room on the 3rd floorLGBT Resource Center, located between Mandeville Center and the Original Student CenterResource Fair on Library Walk and Kahoot Join Health Promotion Services and campus partners to increase awareness and learn more about HIV, Pre-Exposure Prophylaxis (PrEP), and campus resources. Then pick up a red ribbon to show your support in the fight against AIDS. Participate in the World AIDS Day Kahoot (Game Pin: 08847939) to test your knowledge while you wait for your rapid test results. Reduced Cost STI Testing at Student Health Services Lab - Monday, November 30 through Friday, December 4 No-cost HIV testing is also available on Tuesday at Triton Health and Wellness building! Schedule an appointment or walk-in to the lab located on the 1st floor for Self-Directed STI Testing and add on STI testing for $10- $40 this week only – regularly $60 to $205 without UC SHIP or RAFT. Testing Options: Urine Chlamydia and Gonorrhea Testing: $20 Syphilis Testing: $10 HIV Testing: No cost on December 1 or $10 December 2-4\",\n    \"date\": \"2026-12-01\",\n    \"start_time\": \"11:00\",\n    \"end_time\": \"14:00\",\n    \"location\": \"Triton Health and Wellness Building\",\n    \"address\": \"9520 Gilman Dr , La Jolla, CA 92093\",\n    \"provides_food\": true,\n    \"is_free\": true,\n    \"food_description\": \"boba drinks\",\n    \"eligibility\": null,\n    \"registration_url\": null,\n    \"event_url\": \"https://calendar.ucsd.edu/event/world-aids-day-free-rapid-hiv-testing\",\n    \"source_url\": \"https://calendar.ucsd.edu/student-life\",\n    \"evidence\": {\n      \"title\": \"Worl